      "pointer": "/objective_coverage/1/self_check/reference_answer",
      "task_id": null,
      "unchanged_statement": "第一式乘2为2x+4y=6，与第二式相减得0=2，无解，所以两线平行。",
      "previous_source_sha256": "96705269e5835d17b91295d2e015b86ac71388ed3fe1553a19526ad97fa19cd7",
      "current_source_sha256": "96705269e5835d17b91295d2e015b86ac71388ed3fe1553a19526ad97fa19cd7",
      "unchanged_task_sha256": null,
      "retained_original_decision": "x+2y=3乘2后右端为6，第二式2x+4y=8减它得0=2。这个假等式说明联立无解，正是判断两线平行的矛盾结论。",
      "same_source_bytes": true
    },
    {
